  "diagnosis_summary": "Current public Rock source copies each LearningClassActivity when copying a class but does not clone its related LearningActivity, so the copied row retains the original content relationship. The same method also declares a newActivities list but never adds the copied activities before the attribute-save loop. By contrast, the single-activity copy path explicitly clones LearningActivity. This confirms both implementation differences on the reviewed source revision; exact affected release boundaries remain unverified.",
  "workaround_summaries": [
    "Until the class-copy path is corrected, do not edit copied-class activity content under the assumption that it is independent. Build the new class and copy activities individually, then verify each copied LearningClassActivity points to a distinct LearningActivity before changing content."
